            "author": "ijl",
            "time": "2020-02-20T16:55:49Z",
            "text_sha256": "9ee4ac95c7b48d463e5d2b664dbbf075c52fe47a3f2d597020c714165341bca9"
          },
          {
            "evidence_id": "Evidence:4ec4469175ecb49a95c9add9b5488ec174882cb49abb36ca34ba05a435530833",
            "dataset_id": "dataset:0c94c5af1f7f64c628c4a7fe05b496647ad8ef760e18eee01287fd43f1ea3ef2",
            "source_id": "SourceDocument:9ce3b3cf9a606f0a573a39dfa143e2dac20fdfb6ecada2be65b05e6446e6cfd9",
            "start": 282,
            "end": 551,
            "quote": "The reason I have seen mentioned is better performance. That is not the case with at least python3.6+ and a modern distribution (that probably compiled python with PGO and LTO) with simplejson compiled. See [these benchmarks](https://github.com/ijl/orjson#performance).",
            "url": "https://github.com/pallets/itsdangerous/issues/146",
            "author": "ijl",
            "time": "2020-02-20T16:55:49Z",
            "text_sha256": "9ee4ac95c7b48d463e5d2b664dbbf075c52fe47a3f2d597020c714165341bca9"
          },
          {
            "evidence_id": "Evidence:6ebb42bb37f8913613b67c1e9c244f17a77b00b9ed0586fdfc846398cf8bca60",
            "dataset_id": "dataset:0c94c5af1f7f64c628c4a7fe05b496647ad8ef760e18eee01287fd43f1ea3ef2",
            "source_id": "SourceDocument:9ce3b3cf9a606f0a573a39dfa143e2dac20fdfb6ecada2be65b05e6446e6cfd9",
            "start": 553,
            "end": 977,
            "quote": "If simplejson is installed in a container without a compiler, it falls back to running in pure Python. This is a footgun:\n\n```python\nIn [1]: import json, simplejson\n\nIn [2]: data = list(range(0, 100000))\n\nIn [3]: %timeit json.dumps(data)\n17.4 ms ± 1.14 ms per loop (mean ± std. dev. of 7 runs, 100 loops each)\n\nIn [4]: %timeit simplejson.dumps(data)\n89.4 ms ± 7.21 ms per loop (mean ± std. dev. of 7 runs, 10 loops each)\n```",
            "url": "https://github.com/pallets/itsdangerous/issues/146",
            "author": "ijl",
            "time": "2020-02-20T16:55:49Z",
            "text_sha256": "9ee4ac95c7b48d463e5d2b664dbbf075c52fe47a3f2d597020c714165341bca9"
          },
          {
            "evidence_id": "Evidence:475cae1432e70aec369ae3063e6ac39a36a87d5334abd9bb6c1d0fbac5898204",
            "dataset_id": "dataset:0c94c5af1f7f64c628c4a7fe05b496647ad8ef760e18eee01287fd43f1ea3ef2",
            "source_id": "SourceDocument:31446bec65e3f89a3b91d3af911e62869a6c1c924b8fd0cc9bf498e88c57233b",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 222,
            "quote": "``json`` was added to Python 2.6, so the main reason to use ``simplejson`` is backwards compatibility with Python 2.4+ (although, as someone who occasionally has to maintain Python 2.4 code, the sooner it dies the better).",
            "url": "https://github.com/pallets/itsdangerous/issues/146#issuecomment-590060970",
            "author": "CoburnJoe",
            "time": "2020-02-23T11:56:06Z",
            "text_sha256": "2665c315d54416c91121abfd093feab41167edf3223a1b5fd6cd9a6cc45d5e20"
          },
          {
            "evidence_id": "Evidence:5ab2b7cf355822deafa149180eab5440f86aed883ca15201244a6a717a0a99d9",
            "dataset_id": "dataset:0c94c5af1f7f64c628c4a7fe05b496647ad8ef760e18eee01287fd43f1ea3ef2",
            "source_id": "SourceDocument:2e45ef24ed30d85a8f52a07705fd79ca7373b085a9db0695f5e9ef752d4d9524",
            "start": 203,
            "end": 214,
            "quote": "closes #146",
            "url": "https://github.com/pallets/itsdangerous/pull/152",
            "author": "davidism",
            "time": "2020-04-17T17:13:19Z",
            "text_sha256": "6f6f326437fb1cc027c88de7196276841e12420cc9ab9be28c3518314b09973b"
          },
          {
            "evidence_id": "Evidence:e12623bb31e48e68a6461708fb5ea44fa1a0db75e574c1640a9ed87e57e17e4f",
            "dataset_id": "dataset:0c94c5af1f7f64c628c4a7fe05b496647ad8ef760e18eee01287fd43f1ea3ef2",
            "source_id": "SourceDocument:bfc78f7ce3cac7258b166f47cb21ea19095bd76c1ba8ebe6eee1fb4f57b5daa3",
            "start": 17260,
            "end": 17434,
            "quote": "  \"merge_commit_sha\": \"981ade6e73ff9ce420aa29143039de0aaccb9770\",\n  \"mergeable\": false,\n  \"mergeable_state\": \"dirty\",\n  \"merged\": true,\n  \"merged_at\": \"2020-04-17T17:15:12Z\",",
            "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/pallets/itsdangerous/pulls/152",
            "author": null,
            "time": null,
            "text_sha256": "f78fff233eaa0297a02d780af097fa5bf65abd89e4f682a697e041a525e4861f"
          },
          {
            "evidence_id": "Evidence:7f9f519d31f24e9ecf22b1b44cd464a6dc80d2194b351c8c5b1d9d9d1db750a2",
            "dataset_id": "dataset:0c94c5af1f7f64c628c4a7fe05b496647ad8ef760e18eee01287fd43f1ea3ef2",
            "source_id": "SourceDocument:0cb8f3dd94acf3d5ab350d53f3be098b3537f516f27d6f0916ac5ba46d83cfe5",
            "start": 16969,
